# Supabase Auth (Google Sign-in)
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Project Settings > API: copy the Project URL and anon publishable key
# 3. Authentication > Providers > Google: enable and paste the Google OAuth client ID + secret
# 4. Copy the values below and restart the dev server
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your_project_ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_anon_publishable_key
